      "claim_id": "c7",
      "verdict": "SUPPORTED",
      "reasoning": "The passage confirms that BootstrapTransactionId is treated as older than every normal XID.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "quote": "Like FrozenTransactionId, this special XID is treated as older than every normal XID."
